WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,960
Actually I know they are all dead

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,560
When I came out, all nine people around me had disappeared.

3
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:09,290
I never thought that I would be the one who survived in the end.

4
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:11,090
I am an A-level fellow officer with a score of 600.

5
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,330
I'm from the ward on the fourth floor

6
00:00:12,330 --> 00:00:14,650
If you find something is wrong in the dungeon, you will use props to sleep to death.

7
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:15,690
After using up the props

8
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:16,890
I'm good at taking medicine and eating again

9
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,330
Clean up pollution with free props

10
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:19,850
On the third day, the prop broke.

11
00:00:19,850 --> 00:00:21,290
I'll make a deal with the nurse

12
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:23,610
Trade your inner treasure in exchange for normal meals and no medication

13
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:24,730
But the dean is dead

14
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,330
Director student position is dean

15
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,610
The director who admires Ren is the nurse's nemesis

16
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:31,210
The other party directly issued a discharge certificate and released me.

17
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,170
Is the dean actually dead?

18
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:37,430
Then did the Rou family deceive the clan into something weird in the end?

19
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:39,820
Do you want to join our team?

20
00:00:39,820 --> 00:00:40,860
Not cold yet

21
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:46,330
Add contact information first

22
00:00:46,330 --> 00:00:48,350
Where is Rouqi?

23
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:49,550
I'm waiting for her to come out

24
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:52,830
Why hasn't she come out yet?

25
00:00:52,830 --> 00:00:54,820
Why did six people survive?

26
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,380
Counting the soft sounds, isn't there only four?
